WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.163
Food Delivery and Takeaway.

2
00:00:02.443 --> 00:00:06.817
Day 34 of the Soft Skill Playbook course, in the Everyday Life phase.

3
00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:09.591
The key idea.

4
00:00:09.871 --> 00:00:18.084
Today's goal: order food by phone, talk to delivery partners, and solve problems (late, wrong or missing items) with app support.

5
00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:20.287
Part 1.

6
00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:21.527
Key words.

7
00:00:22.777 --> 00:00:24.121
Here is a quick table:

8
00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:35.708
Word or phrase, and Meaning. takeaway or parcel or to go: food you take with you. delivery partner or rider: person who brings the order. order ID: the number of your order.

9
00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:53.268
ETA: expected time of arrival. missing item or wrong item: not in the bag or not what you ordered. spill or leaked: food came out of the box. refund or replacement or coupon: money back or new item or discount. contactless delivery: leave at the door.

10
00:00:54.618 --> 00:00:55.493
Part 2.

11
00:00:55.773 --> 00:00:56.989
Questions you'll ask.

12
00:00:58.239 --> 00:01:00.244
Do you deliver to HSR Layout?

13
00:01:00.524 --> 00:01:01.804
How long will it take?

14
00:01:02.084 --> 00:01:04.175
Is there a minimum order for delivery?

15
00:01:04.455 --> 00:01:05.884
Can you make it less spicy?

16
00:01:06.164 --> 00:01:07.913
Can I pick it up in 20 minutes?

17
00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:11.927
(To rider) Where are you now? / Could you leave it at the gate, please?

18
00:01:12.207 --> 00:01:14.319
(To support) When will I get the refund?

19
00:01:15.669 --> 00:01:16.565
Part 3.

20
00:01:16.845 --> 00:01:19.767
Conversation 1: ordering takeaway by phone.

21
00:01:21.017 --> 00:01:23.044
Here is how the conversation goes.

22
00:01:23.324 --> 00:01:24.988
Hello, Udupi Kitchen.

23
00:01:25.268 --> 00:01:28.361
Hi, I'd like to place a takeaway order, please.

24
00:01:28.641 --> 00:01:29.857
Sure, go ahead.

25
00:01:30.137 --> 00:01:34.511
Two masala dosas, one plate of idli, and two filter coffees.

26
00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:35.921
Anything else?

27
00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:38.871
The conversation continues.

28
00:01:39.151 --> 00:01:41.541
Can you make one dosa without onions?

29
00:01:41.821 --> 00:01:43.186
Yes, no problem.

30
00:01:43.466 --> 00:01:47.242
That's 390. rupeesIt'll be ready in 20 minutes.

31
00:01:47.522 --> 00:01:48.269
Great.

32
00:01:48.549 --> 00:01:50.085
The name is Ashish.

33
00:01:50.365 --> 00:01:52.221
Can I pay when I pick it up?

34
00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.165
Yes, cash or UPI.

35
00:01:54.445 --> 00:01:55.341
Perfect.

36
00:01:55.621 --> 00:01:57.349
See you in 20 minutes.

37
00:01:58.699 --> 00:01:59.616
Part 4.

38
00:01:59.896 --> 00:02:03.096
Conversation 2: missing item, app support chat.

39
00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:06.373
Here is how the conversation goes.

40
00:02:06.653 --> 00:02:08.487
Hi, I'm Neha from support.

41
00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.026
How can I help you?

42
00:02:10.306 --> 00:02:11.373
Hi Neha.

43
00:02:11.653 --> 00:02:15.450
My order just arrived, but the paneer biryani is missing.

44
00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:19.570
The order ID is 48213.

45
00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:21.322
I'm sorry about that.

46
00:02:21.602 --> 00:02:22.690
Let me check.

47
00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.423
Could you share a photo of the items you received?

48
00:02:25.703 --> 00:02:27.389
Sure, I've uploaded it.

49
00:02:28.739 --> 00:02:30.339
The conversation continues.

50
00:02:30.619 --> 00:02:31.728
Thank you.

51
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:34.205
I can see the biryani was not packed.

52
00:02:34.485 --> 00:02:36.789
Would you like a refund or a replacement?

53
00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:38.520
A refund, please.

54
00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.080
It's getting late.

55
00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.192
Done.

56
00:02:41.472 --> 00:02:47.339
280 rupeeswill be refunded to your original payment method in 3 to 5 working days.

57
00:02:47.619 --> 00:02:49.453
Can it go to my wallet instead?

58
00:02:49.733 --> 00:02:51.120
That would be faster.

59
00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.070
The conversation continues.

60
00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.865
Yes, I've changed it.

61
00:02:56.145 --> 00:02:57.574
It's in your wallet now.

62
00:02:57.854 --> 00:02:59.027
Thank you, Neha.

63
00:02:59.307 --> 00:03:00.395
That was quick.

64
00:03:01.745 --> 00:03:02.705
Part 5.

65
00:03:02.985 --> 00:03:04.649
Talking to the delivery partner.

66
00:03:05.899 --> 00:03:08.630
Hi, I'm in Block C, flat 402.

67
00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.361
The lift is on the left.

68
00:03:10.641 --> 00:03:14.097
Please call when you reach the gate; the security will let you in.

69
00:03:14.377 --> 00:03:16.425
Could you leave it with the security guard?

70
00:03:16.705 --> 00:03:17.771
I'm in a meeting.

71
00:03:18.051 --> 00:03:19.950
Take your time, drive safely.

72
00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.239
Part 6.

73
00:03:22.519 --> 00:03:23.692
When things go wrong.

74
00:03:24.942 --> 00:03:27.395
The food is cold or spilled or not sealed.

75
00:03:27.675 --> 00:03:29.169
This isn't what I ordered.

76
00:03:29.449 --> 00:03:31.262
I ordered veg, this is chicken.

77
00:03:31.542 --> 00:03:34.571
It's been over an hour, and the order still says preparing.

78
00:03:34.851 --> 00:03:36.259
I was charged twice.

79
00:03:37.609 --> 00:03:38.548
Part 7.

80
00:03:38.828 --> 00:03:39.745
Practice.

81
00:03:40.995 --> 00:03:46.798
Write a 3-line support message about a late order: what happened, the order ID, what you want.

82
00:03:48.148 --> 00:03:49.065
Success:

83
00:03:49.345 --> 00:03:50.433
Sample answer.

84
00:03:50.713 --> 00:03:59.417
Hi, my order (ID 59120) was due at 8:15 but it's 9:00 and it hasn't arrived.

85
00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:01.553
The rider isn't answering calls.

86
00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:04.351
Please cancel it and give me a full refund.

87
00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:06.575
Part 8.

88
00:04:06.855 --> 00:04:07.901
Speak today.

89
00:04:09.151 --> 00:04:11.967
Order food or coffee in English (phone or counter).

90
00:04:12.247 --> 00:04:15.127
Give clear directions to your home in 2 sentences.

91
00:04:16.477 --> 00:04:18.013
That's the end of this lesson.

92
00:04:18.293 --> 00:04:22.943
Pick one script from it, say it out loud three times, and use it for real today.

93
00:04:23.223 --> 00:04:29.346
For extra practice, paste the Master Prompt into an AI assistant and role-play the conversation.

